WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:01.517
Much shorter version

00:00:01.329 --> 00:00:02.566
of GRH Lean

00:00:02.378 --> 00:00:04.288
verification from Anthropic

00:00:04.806 --> 00:00:05.796
A much shorter

00:00:05.608 --> 00:00:06.975
version of Anthropic's

00:00:06.787 --> 00:00:08.261
Lean formalization

00:00:08.332 --> 00:00:09.923
verifying the Generalized

00:00:09.735 --> 00:00:11.150
Riemann Hypothesis

00:00:11.289 --> 00:00:14.201
Needs Lean v4.35.0

00:00:14.025 --> 00:00:15.251
and Mathlib at

00:00:15.063 --> 00:00:18.388
commit 56a00585

00:00:18.910 --> 00:00:19.829
A build takes

00:00:19.641 --> 00:00:20.372
one to two

00:00:20.184 --> 00:00:21.280
hours on 12

00:00:21.092 --> 00:00:23.096
cores with 24 GB

00:00:22.908 --> 00:00:23.721
of memory

00:00:24.254 --> 00:00:25.103
The proof is

00:00:24.914 --> 00:00:25.987
based on Levent

00:00:25.822 --> 00:00:27.237
Alpöge's with Claude

00:00:27.308 --> 00:00:28.664
This repository is

00:00:28.476 --> 00:00:29.525
a shorter version

00:00:29.690 --> 00:00:31.187
produced in collaboration

00:00:30.999 --> 00:00:31.978
with my colleagues

00:00:31.789 --> 00:00:32.815
at Anthropic

00:00:32.839 --> 00:00:33.629
and Claude

00:00:34.158 --> 00:00:35.172
Full story on

00:00:34.983 --> 00:00:35.879
the dashboard
